					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111618,
					"content": "呃，真是不好开口啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111619,
					"content": "我们这儿的<color=#00E1FFFF>后山</color>上也有<color=#00E1FFFF>陨石</color>，村里那个<color=#00E1FFFF>艾伦</color>，吵着要去见识一下，一个人就冲出去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111620,
					"content": "陨石的危险性你们也看到了，我担心他出什么意外，想请各位跟我走一趟，把他接回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111621,
					"content": "都这么危险了，他还去凑什么热闹呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111622,
					"content": "就是！等这小子回来，一定要狠狠骂他一顿！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111623,
					"content": "说得对，那我们现在就去找他吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
